  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Study Studio",
    "overview": "A study studio organized like a notebook: warm paper surrounds clean work sheets, while burnt orange marks actions and selected modes. Quiet borders and direct Vietnamese typography keep attention on recall and feedback.\n\nThe shared system serves all three subjects with compact navigation and minimal repeated copy.",
